      "writtenOn": "2023-09-05T15:26:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Perhaps this assumption was invalidated by http://review.skia.org/19840. That CL says that we can assume the dst alpha is 1 on this code path, which would mean that the resulting alpha would be 1 regardless of coverage alpha. However, I tested this locally and it looks like this code path is taken regardless of dst alpha. So I believe this CL is matching the current functionality of Ganesh. Maybe we can accept this as good-enough-for-now, and revisit whether we want to correct this later?",
      "parentUuid": "0ac9c4b3_dae94d19",
